<h3><u>Bohot ro chuki hai sakina</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><span class=""Apple-style-span""  arial, sans-serif; line-height: normal; border-collapse: collapse; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); ""><p>Haaye haaye haaye x3</p><p>khaamoshiyon se hi pucho, in aasuon se hi pucho x2</p><p>bade zulm raaho me sehti rahi hai, yateemi ke taane yeh sehti rahi hai, nahi maar zalim tamaache ise, na kar iska dushwaar jeena,</p><p>bohut ro chuki hai sakina x2</p><p>Safar me yeh soyi na zindaan me aakar, ujaala kiya hai yaha dil jala kar, padar se jo bichdi hai ashooor ko, sukoon paa saki phir kabhi na,</p><p>bohut ro chuki hai sakina x2</p><p>mila dasht me jab k baba ka laasha, lipat k padar se kiya khoob girya, waha pahunchi zainab toh sheh ne kaha, sulaa do ise jaa ke behnaa,</p><p>bohut ro chuki hai sakina x2</p><p>rasan de gyi hai nishaani gale par, hai peshaani zakhmi jo khaaye the patthar, nishaan hai tamachon k rukhsaar par, masaaeb se zakhmi hai seena,</p><p>bohut ro chuki hai sakina x2</p><p>kabhi apne baba k qatil se darkar, kabhi royi zindaan me tanhaaiyon par, kabhi boli zainab k ab ghar chalo, hua ek baras ek mahina,</p><p>bohut ro chuki hai sakina x2</p><p>Qayamat ki ek raat aisi bhi aayi, qaza ne sakina ko loree sunaayi, kaha roke sajjad ne aye phuphi, ke ab royegi phir kabhi na,</p><p>bohut ro chuki hai sakina x2</p><p>jo qabr-e-sakina pe rote the qaidi, toh un ronewalon se baano yeh kehti, abhi thak ke soyi hai zindaan me, jagaana ise ab koi na,</p><p>bohut ro chuki hai sakina x2</p><p>yeh kehta hai farhan se roke mazhar, jo qabr-e-sakina pe jaana biradar, waha marsiya jaake kehna yehi, bohut ro chuki hai sakinaa,</p><p>bohut ro chuki hai sakina x2</p></span></p>
